id: pm-eax4y8
title: History drift scan hashes reordered linked-test projections
description: "Strict history-drift validation currently hashes the normalized bulk-enumeration projection, which can reorder linked tests relative to the authoritative item document and latest history snapshot. This produces a false hash mismatch even while pm history --verify reports a valid chain and current_matches_latest=true. Preserve authoritative collection order for integrity hashing and prove cached and source scans agree."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-11T23:47:01.395Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-12T01:40:24.211Z"
assignee: "harness:codex"
claim_principal: "harness:codex#09d99a3d99ca542892066fe0"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: pm validate --check-history-drift agrees with pm history --verify for valid items whose linked tests are stored in noncanonical order; strict cached and force-source validation hash the authoritative item document rather than a reordered derived projection; regression coverage exercises the real document and history chain without coverage exemptions
parent: pm-usfg
severity: high
